--- a/.chj-home/.xscreensaver
+++ b/.chj-home/.xscreensaver
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 # XScreenSaver Preferences File
-# Written by xscreensaver-demo 5.45 for chris on Sat Nov 27 03:04:22 2021.
